---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /teaching/
active: teaching
bodyClass: on-paper
title: Teaching
description: "Organ, piano and music theory at California Lutheran University and the Colburn School, plus masterclasses, residencies and workshops for parish musicians."
---
<section class="page-head has-photo">
  <img class="head-img" src="/assets/img/press/conducting-bw-web.jpg" alt="" width="960" height="960" style="object-position:50% 62%">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Teaching</p>
    <h1>From the studio to the choir loft.</h1>
    <p class="lede">{{ teaching.intro }}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cards">
    {%- for a in teaching.areas %}
      <div class="card reveal">
        <h3>{{ a.title }}</h3>
        <p class="fine" style="margin:-.2rem 0 .8rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.72rem;color:var(--brass-deep)">{{ a.place }}</p>
        <p>{{ a.body }}</p>
      </div>
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section dark">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="rule-head"><span class="lbl">Beyond the studio</span><span class="rule"></span></div>
      <h2>What he brings on the road.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="stack">
      {%- for o in teaching.offers %}
        <div class="entry"><span class="yr">&mdash;</span><div>{{ o }}</div></div>
      {%- endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a class="btn btn-brass" href="/contact/">Ask about teaching</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
